      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Writes the source object to an output stream using Java serialization.\nThe source object must implement <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/io/Serializable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.io\"><code>Serializable</code></a>.",
